  "ORACLE_ARM_IS_NOT_LIVE_PERFORMANCE": "WEEKLY_CAPPED_ORACLE is fed the set of players who actually appeared in the scored week so the cap falls on the right player. That is an oracle condition, the same kind as feeding a simulator the actual batting order, and it must never be quoted as live performance. The gap between it and WEEKLY_CAPPED_PREGAME is what an injury report would be worth, and no injury report exists in this checkout for a past Sunday (OUT-038).",
